["```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([dplyr](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org))\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)(dslabs)\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([data.table](https://r-datatable.com))\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt <- [as.data.table](https://rdatatable.gitlab.io/data.table/reference/as.data.table.html)(murders)\n```", "```r\n[select](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/select.html)(murders, state, region)\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[, [c](https://rdrr.io/r/base/c.html)(\"state\", \"region\")] \n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[, .(state, region)] \n```", "```r\nmurders <- [mutate](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/mutate.html)(murders, rate = total / population * 100000)\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[, rate := total / population * 100000]\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[, \":=\"(rate = total / population * 100000, rank = [rank](https://rdrr.io/r/base/rank.html)(population))]\n```", "```r\nx <- [data.table](https://rdatatable.gitlab.io/data.table/reference/data.table.html)(a = 1)\ny <- x\n```", "```r\nx[, a := 2]\ny\n#>        a\n#>    <num>\n#> 1:     2\n```", "```r\ny[, a := 1]\nx\n#>        a\n#>    <num>\n#> 1:     1\n```", "```r\nx <- [data.table](https://rdatatable.gitlab.io/data.table/reference/data.table.html)(a = 1)\ny <- [copy](https://rdatatable.gitlab.io/data.table/reference/copy.html)(x)\nx[, a := 2]\ny\n#>        a\n#>    <num>\n#> 1:     1\n```", "```r\nx <- [data.frame](https://rdrr.io/r/base/data.frame.html)(a = 1)\n[setDT](https://rdatatable.gitlab.io/data.table/reference/setDT.html)(x)\n```", "```r\nx <- [data.frame](https://rdrr.io/r/base/data.frame.html)(a = 1)\ny <- [setDT](https://rdatatable.gitlab.io/data.table/reference/setDT.html)(x)\n```", "```r\nx[, a := 2]\ny\n#>        a\n#>    <num>\n#> 1:     2\n```", "```r\n[filter](https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/reference/filter.html)(murders, rate <= 0.7)\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[rate <= 0.7]\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[rate <= 0.7, .(state, rate)]\n#>            state  rate\n#