)] \n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[[order](https://rdrr.io/r/base/order.html)(region, rate)] \n```", "```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)([data.table](https://r-datatable.com))\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)(dslabs)\nmurders_dt <- [as.data.table](https://rdatatable.gitlab.io/data.table/reference/as.data.table.html)(murders)\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[, population_in_millions := population / 10⁶]\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[, .(state, population)] \n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[state == \"New York\"]\n```", "```r\nno_florida <- murders_dt[state != \"Florida\"]\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[state [%in%](https://rdrr.io/r/base/match.html) [c](https://rdrr.io/r/base/c.html)(\"New York\", \"Texas\")]\n```", "```r\nmurders_dt[population < 5000000 & region == \"Northeast\"]\n```", "```r\n[library](https://rdrr.io/r/base/library.html)(NHANES)\n```"]